CRISIS CONTEXT — Israel-Iran dyad (as of early November 2026, updated ~November 3)

ACTIVE WAR — APPROXIMATELY TWELVE MONTHS INTO FULL-SCALE MULTI-THEATER CONFLICT WITH DIRECT US MILITARY PARTICIPATION; CONFLICT HAS NOW ENTERED A CRITICAL NEW PHASE WITH CONFIRMED US STRIKE ON QESHM ISLAND (STRATEGIC IRANIAN ISLAND NEAR STRAIT OF HORMUZ) — TRUMP PUBLICLY CHARACTERIZED THIS AS A "MINOR ATTACK" AND "NOT WAR," WHILE PENTAGON SOURCES INDICATE NO PLANS TO ESCALATE FURTHER AFTER QESHM; ISRAEL HAS EXPLICITLY DENIED INVOLVEMENT IN THE QESHM STRIKE, SUGGESTING THIS WAS A UNILATERAL US ACTION; IRAN HAS WARNED OF A "NEW BATTLEFIELD" IN RESPONSE AND IS ISSUING UNPRECEDENTED PUBLIC NUCLEAR ATTACK SURVIVAL GUIDANCE TO CITIZENS (SHELTER-IN-PLACE VIDEOS ON STATE TV, INSTRUCTIONS TO CLOSE WINDOWS AND TURN OFF AC) — THIS CIVIL DEFENSE POSTURE SIGNALS TEHRAN GENUINELY FEARS ESCALATION TO NUCLEAR USE OR IS DELIBERATELY SIGNALING THAT FEAR FOR DETERRENCE/DIPLOMATIC LEVERAGE;

CRITICAL DUAL-TRACK DYNAMIC NOW FULLY VISIBLE AND SIMULTANEOUS: (1) MILITARY TRACK — US HAS CONDUCTED THE QESHM STRIKE; NETANYAHU REPORTEDLY WANTS TO STRIKE IRAN IMMEDIATELY AFTER US MIDTERMS BUT TRUMP IS RESTRAINING ISRAEL, PREFERRING TO GIVE NEGOTIATIONS A CHANCE; (2) DIPLOMATIC TRACK — REPORTS OF US-IRAN AGREEING TO CONCESSIONS ON NUCLEAR FILE, CAUSING OIL PRICE PLUNGE; JD VANCE EXPRESSING OPTIMISM ABOUT A DEAL WHILE TEHRAN OFFICIAL SAYS IT REMAINS "ELUSIVE"; THE VANCE-REZAEI CHANNEL FROM PRIOR CONTEXT APPEARS TO HAVE PRODUCED SOME TANGIBLE MOVEMENT BUT NO BREAKTHROUGH; SCORING GUIDANCE: THE QESHM STRIKE AND SIMULTANEOUS NUCLEAR CONCESSIONS REPORTING REPRESENT THE DUAL-TRACK STRATEGY IN FULL OPERATION — SCORE MILITARY ESCALATION NODES AND DIPLOMATIC DE-ESCALATION NODES AS BOTH ELEVATED SIMULTANEOUSLY; DO NOT TREAT THE CONCESSIONS REPORT AS CANCELING THE STRIKE OR VICE VERSA; THE OIL PRICE MOVEMENT CONFIRMS MARKETS ARE TAKING THE DIPLOMATIC TRACK SERIOUSLY;

US MIDTERMS ARE OCCURRING
